home='''<section class="home-hero"><img class="hero-photo" src="assets/images/port.jpg" alt="Shipping containers and cranes at a busy international port" fetchpriority="high"><div class="hero-shade"></div><div class="container hero-content"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR PARTNER IN GLOBAL TRADE</span><h1>Local understanding.<br>Global <em>possibilities.</em></h1><p>From finding the right supplier to coordinating your next shipment, we connect your business with opportunities beyond borders.</p><div class="actions">'''+btn('Start your sourcing request')+btn('Discover our services','services.html',True)+'''</div><div class="hero-bottom"><span>PRODUCT SOURCING</span><i></i><span>IMPORT & EXPORT</span><i></i><span>TRADE CONSULTING</span></div></div><span class="hero-caption">A world of opportunity. A clear way forward.</span></section><section class="intro-strip"><div class="container strip-grid"><div><b>01</b><span>Find the right<br><strong>products & partners</strong></span></div><div><b>02</b><span>Navigate your<br><strong>cross-border trade</strong></span></div><div><b>03</b><span>Stay informed<br><strong>from request to delivery</strong></span></div></div></section><section class="section container"><div class="split-heading">'''+heading('WHAT WE DO','Trade made simpler.<br>Business taken further.','Practical support across the sourcing and trading journey, built around what your business needs.')+'''<a class="text-link" href="services.html">All our services ↗</a></div>'''+cards()+'''</section><section class="section soft"><div class="container editorial"><div class="image-stack"><img src="assets/images/warehouse.jpg" alt="Warehouse shelves and cargo ready for dispatch" loading="lazy"><div class="image-note">One coordinated journey.<br><strong>From sourcing to delivery.</strong></div></div><div>'''+heading('WHY WORK WITH JKM','More clarity.<br>At every step.','Buying across borders brings enough moving parts. We help you keep the requirements, costs and next steps in view.')+'''<ul class="check-list"><li><strong>Requirements first</strong><span>We start with your specifications, quantities and destination.</span></li><li><strong>A proposal you can review</strong><span>Understand the scope, commercial terms and agreed service fees before proceeding.</span></li><li><strong>Coordinated communication</strong><span>Get updates as your order moves through the agreed stages.</span></li></ul>'''+btn('Get to know JKM','about.html',True)+'''</div></div></section><section class="section container">'''+heading('HOW IT WORKS','From an idea to a clear next step.','A straightforward process, with your approval at the important decisions.')+'''<div class="steps">'''+''.join(f'<div><span>0{i+1}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></div>' for i,(t,d) in enumerate([('Tell us what you need','Send your product details, quantities and destination.'),('Review your proposal','Compare the scope, pricing and terms before committing.'),('Confirm & proceed','Approve the offer and agreed payment arrangements.'),('Stay in the loop','Receive updates on purchasing, checks and shipment coordination.')]))+'''</div><a class="text-link" href="how-it-works.html">See the complete process ↗</a></section><section class="industry-banner"><img src="assets/images/products.jpg" alt="Retail products and shopping supplies" loading="lazy"><div class="container"><span class="eyebrow">BUILT AROUND YOUR BUSINESS</span><h2>Different industries.<br>The same attention to detail.</h2><p>Retail, hospitality, business supplies and more.<br>Tell us what you’re looking for.</p>'''+btn('Explore product categories','products.html')+'''</div></section>'''+cta()
page('index.html','Global sourcing, import & export','Source products, coordinate imports and exports, and plan international trade with JKM Global Traders.',home)
about=hero('About JKM','We connect ambition<br>with opportunity.','JKM Global Traders supports businesses with product sourcing, procurement and cross-border trade coordination.','meeting')+'<section class="section container editorial"><div>'+heading('OUR APPROACH','A practical partner<br>for your next move.','Our role is to help you bring the commercial details together: what you need, where it comes from, how it is checked and how it reaches its destination.')+'<p>We work from your requirements, coordinate supplier communication and help you assess options before you make purchasing decisions. Each engagement starts with an agreed scope and clear responsibilities.</p><p>Where specialist services are required, including freight and customs clearance, we coordinate with suitable partners. Availability, routes and delivery terms are confirmed for each order.</p></div><div class="statement"><span class="eyebrow">OUR PURPOSE</span><h2>Connecting Markets.<br><em>Delivering Value.</em></h2><p>To make sourcing and trade coordination easier to understand and manage for the businesses we serve.</p></div></section><section class="section soft"><div class="container">'+heading('WHAT GUIDES US','Clear expectations. Lasting relationships.')+'<div class="three-grid">'+''.join(f'<article class="plain-card"><span class="icon-box">{icon(i)}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{d}</p></article>' for i,t,d in [('check','Clarity','Explain scope, costs and responsibilities before work begins.'),('shield','Care','Review details and raise questions before committing to a purchase.'),('globe','Coordination','Keep customers and service partners aligned throughout the order.')])+'</div></div></section>'+cta()
