page('services.html','Our services','Explore sourcing, import and export support, supplier checks, logistics and trade consulting.',hero('Our services','From the first search.<br>To the next market.','Choose focused support for a single task, or ask us to coordinate several stages of your trading journey.')+'<section class="section container">'+cards()+'</section><section class="section soft"><div class="container editorial">'+heading('A CLEAR SCOPE','The right support<br>for your requirements.','Every product and route is different. Your quotation will set out the specific work we will undertake and any services provided through third parties.')+'<div><h3>Before we begin, we confirm:</h3><ul class="check-list"><li>Product specifications and quantities</li><li>Service scope, fees and payment terms</li><li>Origin, destination and proposed timing</li><li>Inspection, shipping and document responsibilities</li></ul></div></div></section>'+cta())
